^SAMPLE = GSM5319987
!Sample_title = Brain Sham rep1
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM5319987
!Sample_status = Public on Sep 24 2021
!Sample_submission_date = May 17 2021
!Sample_last_update_date = Jul 02 2026
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = Brain
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Mus musculus
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 10090
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = strain: C57BL/6
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: Brain
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = age: 6-8 weeks
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: sham
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = The brain was dissected and minced using a scalpel for digestion with papain for 30 minutes at 37°C. After incubation, the mixture was centrifuged at 300g for 5 minutes at room temperature. The cell suspension was then passed through a 40 μm cell strainer and centrifuged at 300 g for 5 minutes. Cell pellets were resuspended in 10 ml of 30% Percoll in PBS and then centrifuged at 700 g for 10 min to remove myelin debris. After the myelin debris fraction floating on the surface was removed, the pelleted cells were immediately resuspended with FACS buffer. Live/dead discrimination reagents for flow cytometry were prepared using Zombie NIR Fixable Viability Kit.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Single Cell 3’ Library was constructed mainly following Chromium Single Cell 3' Reagent Kits User Guide
!Sample_data_processing = The single-cell RNA sequencing data was further analyzed by using the 10x Cell Ranger.Briefly, FASTQ files were generated by demultiplexing the Illumina sequencer's base call files (BCLs), and  then alignment, filtering, barcode and UMI counting were processed. STAR（Spliced Transcripts Alignment to  a Reference）was utilized to perform the read alignments to mouse reference transcriptome (mm10). Cell  Ranger was employed to conduct primary quality control (QC) on the FASTQ files to generate high quality  scRNA-seq data.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Matrix table with raw gene counts for every gene and every cell
!Sample_platform_id = GPL21103
!Sample_contact_name = Kai,,Zheng
!Sample_contact_institute = Tianjin Medical University General Hospital
!Sample_contact_address = No.154 Anshan Road, Heping District
!Sample_contact_city = Tianjin
!Sample_contact_zip/postal_code = 300052
!Sample_contact_country = China
!Sample_instrument_model = Illumina HiSeq 4000
!Sample_library_selection = cDNA
!Sample_library_source = transcriptomic
!Sample_library_strategy = RNA-Seq
!Sample_relation = BioSample: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/biosample/SAMN19235062
!Sample_relation = SRA: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sra?term=SRX10913833
